Z||000003||JohnF||11-05-2001||07:38 PM||||My Pontiac dealer will make any key for the Fiero as of last week.  Take the VIN and proof of ownership (insurance, title, license renewal, whatever) and prove you own the car, he'll make the key that fits (assuming , of course that someone hasn't changed the lockset).  It that doesn't work, go to a locksmith or tear up the decklid and buy replacement parts later!<BR>Good luck!||||reg||1
